      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi David, \n\nI tried to add the property to `p/m/Bluetooth/sysprop`, I found I need to set the function to `Public` in order to call in Java layer, however, this will required an API. As we just need to read the property, I would prefer to keep the current implementation without adding API.",
